# W3-C2..C6 — the five hue restorations. Each is themed to its district and
# each ends with palette_bloom flooding outward from the tower (CANON 8.2).
# The bloom is the showpiece; the writing gets out of its way.

cut ch1_hue_blue
  BG ch1_dock
  MUSIC MOOD_HARBOR
  TITLE "Chapter One" "The Harbour"
  WAIT 2.4
  ACTOR you 300 534
  ACTOR otto 560 534
  ACTOR tansy 780 546
  EMOTE otto worried
  SAY otto "So that is it, then. I am not the one."
  EMOTE you neutral
  SAY you "You were never the one. You were a man carrying a pail up a hill in the dark."
  EMOTE otto moved
  SAY otto "...Do not make a speech of it."
  EMOTE tansy happy
  SAY tansy "I TOLD everyone. I told them and told them."
  WAIT 0.6
  MOVE you 640 524 1.4
  SAY you "Somebody went up that tower with a lamp and never came down."
  WAIT 0.8
  SFX chime
  BLOOM 1090 300 1
  MUSIC MOOD_TOWN
  WAIT 1.6
  SAY tansy "...The sea. Look at the SEA."
  EMOTE otto happy
  SAY otto "Blue. Would you look at that. Blue."
  WAIT 1.4
  DOODLE wave 300 470 26
  DOODLE wave 900 480 26
  SAY you "One hue back. Five to go, and a town to ask about all of them."
  WAIT 1.0
  EXIT

cut ch2_hue_yellow
  BG ch2_row
  MUSIC MOOD_MARKET
  TITLE "Chapter Two" "Market Row"
  WAIT 2.4
  ACTOR you 320 526
  ACTOR greta 600 524
  ACTOR felix 840 524
  EMOTE greta worried
  SAY greta "Say it out loud, dear. You have been carrying it up the Row all morning."
  SAY you "Nobody broke into the Prismworks."
  SAY you "Iris Marlow borrowed a set of picks and let herself in."
  EMOTE felix worried
  SAY felix "And locked it again behind her. Which is not what a thief does."
  EMOTE greta sad
  SAY greta "It is what somebody does who means to come straight back down."
  WAIT 1.0
  SFX chime
  BLOOM 1120 430 2
  WAIT 1.6
  EMOTE greta happy
  SAY greta "Oh — oh, the bunting. Three years I have kept that up."
  DOODLE bread 420 520 26
  DOODLE spool 700 520 24
  EMOTE felix laughing
  SAY felix "Yellow. The awnings are yellow. I had forgotten they were anything."
  WAIT 1.2
  SAY you "She let herself in. So where did she go?"
  WAIT 1.0
  EXIT

cut ch3_hue_red
  BG ch3_lane
  MUSIC MOOD_QUARTER
  TITLE "Chapter Three" "The Old Quarter"
  WAIT 2.4
  ACTOR you 340 522
  ACTOR edwina 620 520
  ACTOR bartleby 860 518
  EMOTE edwina sad
  SAY edwina "Say it kindly. She is my sister's girl."
  SAY you "The Prism has been cracking for three years."
  SAY you "Iris knew. She has been mending it herself, at night, out of her own wages."
  EMOTE bartleby moved
  SAY bartleby "She sat in my reading room and read exactly why it was failing."
  EMOTE bartleby sad
  SAY bartleby "And she did not say one word to me about it. Not one."
  EMOTE edwina moved
  SAY edwina "She would not. That is the whole trouble with her. That is the whole of it."
  WAIT 1.0
  SFX chime
  BLOOM 1030 200 3
  WAIT 1.6
  DOODLE clock 1030 200 40
  EMOTE bartleby happy
  SAY bartleby "Red. Good heavens. The brick is red."
  SAY you "She was mending it. So she went up there to mend it."
  EMOTE edwina worried
  SAY edwina "...And then what."
  WAIT 1.2
  EXIT

cut ch4_hue_green
  BG ch4_garden
  MUSIC MOOD_GARDEN
  TITLE "Chapter Four" "The Gardens"
  WAIT 2.4
  ACTOR you 340 524
  ACTOR sage 600 522
  ACTOR poppy 830 522
  ACTOR mo 1020 522
  EMOTE sage worried
  SAY sage "Go on. I have been watering gray flowers for a month, I can take it."
  SAY you "The Prism is not a lamp. It is a jar."
  SAY you "The Festival of Lanterns is how the town fills it."
  EMOTE poppy neutral
  SAY poppy "And we have not filled it in three years."
  EMOTE sage sad
  SAY sage "Rain. Then money. Then nothing at all."
  EMOTE mo moved
  SAY mo "The bees never stopped going. Somebody should say that out loud."
  SAY you "Somebody just did."
  WAIT 0.8
  SFX chime
  BLOOM 1130 410 4
  WAIT 1.6
  DOODLE flower 420 540 22
  DOODLE flower 700 548 22
  DOODLE flower 960 536 22
  EMOTE sage moved
  SAY sage "...They were scarlet. I told everyone they were scarlet."
  EMOTE poppy happy
  SAY poppy "You did. At length. You were right."
  WAIT 1.4
  EXIT

cut ch5_hue_violet
  BG ch5_green
  MUSIC MOOD_TOWER
  TITLE "Chapter Five" "Tower Green"
  WAIT 2.4
  ACTOR you 340 526
  ACTOR nona 580 524
  ACTOR mayor 800 524
  ACTOR wick 1010 522
  EMOTE nona worried
  SAY nona "Third lamp. I said the third lamp."
  SFX door
  SAY you "It was under the third lamp. It has been under the third lamp for three years."
  EMOTE mayor sad
  SAY mayor "While I cancelled the reason anybody would need it."
  SAY you "She is in the lantern room. She has been there since last night."
  EMOTE wick worried
  SAY wick "The stair went behind her. I said. I said it twice and it went in a folder."
  EMOTE nona moved
  SAY nona "Then open it. Open it now."
  WAIT 0.8
  SFX chime
  BLOOM 640 430 5
  SHAKE 4 0.5
  WAIT 1.8
  EMOTE mayor moved
  SAY mayor "Violet. The hill goes violet at dusk. I had forgotten that entirely."
  SAY you "Up the stair, then. Mind the third plank."
  WAIT 1.2
  EXIT
